{"id": "1913363", "name": "גבול מורכב באמצעות פולינומי מקלורן", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396484_LHOPITAL_MACLAURIN_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">גבול מורכב באמצעות פולינומי מקלורן</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>חשבו את הגבול באמצעות פיתוחי מקלורן מתאימים</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396484_LHOPITAL_MACLAURIN_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>נסמן \\(\\displaystyle a={{CT:2}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle b={{CT:3}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle c={{CT:4}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle d={{CT:5}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle e={{CT:6}}\\)</p>\n<p>נפתח את המונה עד סדר ארבע</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln\\left(1+a x^2\\right)=a x^2-\\frac{a^2}{2}x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{a}{b}x\\sin\\left(bx\\right)=a x^2-\\frac{ab^2}{6}x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}=\\frac{a\\left(b^2-3a\\right)}{6}x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>כעת נפתח את המכנה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle e^{c x^2}-1-c x^2=\\frac{c^2}{2}x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\cos\\left(e x\\right)-1+\\frac{e^2x^2}{2}=\\frac{e^4}{24}x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}=\\left(\\frac{c^2}{2}+\\frac{d e^4}{24}\\right)x^4+O\\left(x^6\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>אחרי צמצום החזקה המובילה מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}}={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 22, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if is(equal(radcan(ans1),radcan(limit))) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "den", "g", "limit", "num"], "nvariants": 50}